<title>HONG KONG: CITIC says no immediate placement plan.</title>
<headline>CITIC says no immediate placement plan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of CITIC Pacific Ltd fell sharply Thursday afternoon on talk that the company was planning a share placement but an official said the company had no immediate plans.</p>
<p>&quot;The company has no such plan,&quot; the CITIC official said.</p>
<p>Shares of CITIC fell 60 cents to HK$33.10 in late afternoon on volume of 3.69 million shares worth HK$123.36 million.</p>
</text>
